meta {
  name: Decline Invitation
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/invitations/{{invitationToken}}/decline
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  # Decline Invitation

  Decline an invitation to join a trip.

  **Permission Required:** None (public endpoint, no authentication required)

  **URL Parameters:**
  - `invitationToken`: The secure token from the invitation link

  **Notes:**
  - No authentication required (can be declined without logging in)
  - Validates the token
  - Updates invitation status to "declined"
  - Records the decline timestamp
  - The invitation link becomes invalid
  - Returns 404 if token is invalid
  - Returns 400 if invitation is already used or cancelled
}
